# @auki/$crate_package_name

wasm-bindgen JavaScript bindings for `auki-layout`.

```js
import init, { sensorEntryPath } from "./$generated_js_file";

await init();
console.log(sensorEntryPath("/app", "K1/head", "abcd"));
```

The package exposes string adapters over the same binding-free path helpers used by Rust.
